ype=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/1423c7dafac902218bdf50ebbd279e88.mp4?t=1780936273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Claymatic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a small indie studio with a love for stop-motion animation. We have a passion for straightforward, honest games with uncomplicated and effective mechanics that deliver fun gameplay and can be played over and over without ever feeling old. Our community means everything to us; we play, bounce ideas and chat very openly about everything we do and work on. We are firm believers in open development and transparency.</p>",
